{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f7682776dd8b96cb2bc09db933a9058ee9e1cf1438b816f8a37dbb3617b76332", "ja": "（ドラマ『聖ミリオン女学園』が好評で、\n追加で取材が入った。今日は、海美の番だ）", "zh": "（电视剧《圣百万女子学园》大受好评，又安排了追加采访。今天轮到海美了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "3f10a43337a87ca3f7c99019bf32ac7358420a4ae88b1e8e9180761d830e3808", "ja": "{$P$}、おはようございます。\n本日もよろしくお願いいたしますわね。", "zh": "{$P$}，早上好。\n今天也请多多关照呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9f2366abab57c0a86fa1cc92d1cac7e4c75d555ca1c11733fe325f4499829ce2", "ja": "おはよう、海美！　あれ、今日は撮影と\nインタビューだけなのに、お嬢さまモードなのか？", "zh": "早上好，海美！咦，明明今天只有拍摄和采访，你怎么进入大小姐模式了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "bde1f3a99ad7af0b08adf844cd27499fa32d5d60518fbade9218af49502b1483", "ja": "えっ！？　今日のインタビューって、\nお嬢さま風に答えなくちゃダメなんじゃないの？", "zh": "咦！？今天的采访，不是必须用大小姐风格回答吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d1d06b98fd6b68a7cfd8e44d829941f5adbf67d744cb80c85de3e2e5786fd5f8", "ja": "いや、そんなことはないと思うけど……素の海美が、\nどう役を演じているかを話せばいいんだし。", "zh": "不，我觉得不用那样……只要聊聊平时的海美是怎么扮演角色的就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "175d3339458231cac1a6a8e00579ef97ec459f9650aa75e213f6b4f6abd93a7d", "ja": "なんだ、そっかー！　私、役になりきって\nしゃべらなくちゃいけないのかと思ってたっ！", "zh": "什么嘛，原来是这样——！我还以为必须完全融入角色来说话呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "813e5283c09ad16056f8715cba3261fe7d061d7173b972635550a8829833fc24", "ja": "だから元気を控えめにして、お嬢さまっぽく……\nでも、台本がないから難しいなって。", "zh": "所以要收敛一点活力，表现得像大小姐一样……\n可是没有剧本，我觉得还挺难的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1007_p", "source_sha256": "851f33f6d5b54f68512a58c25a27cf53fe17d561fdb97e46821c38122d0cc848", "ja": "はは、なるほど。お嬢さまらしい雰囲気になるように、\n海美なりに考えて準備してくれたんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。为了营造出大小姐般的氛围，你也按照自己的方式思考准备了一番啊，海美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "cdb506bb9e19ab64a36278f676ff6353f0ee6dd23362559605eba313a2f90a59", "ja": "えへへ♪　ほめられるほどのことじゃないけど、\nいちおう、私なりにね！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪也没什么值得夸奖的啦，不过，姑且算是我按照自己的方式准备的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1009_p", "source_sha256": "947284c0ec4e023afa9432c378038012d644910f662e3c45136e05410f89f2b3", "ja": "撮影も、頑張ってたしな。ドラマの海美は、強気で\n活発そうに見えて、繊細で……難しい役だったと思う。", "zh": "你在拍摄中也很努力呢。电视剧里的海美看起来强势又活泼，其实内心细腻……我觉得这是个很难演的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "8c12915271e7bf6c02399c1a66dc01a77ccc6859a1a6e46e3ab6d7237db27367", "ja": "うん。育りんに意地悪しちゃう理由とかも、私なりに\nいろいろ考えて……難しかったけど、がんばったっ！", "zh": "嗯。我也按照自己的理解，认真想了很多为什么要对育琳使坏之类的……虽然很难，但我努力过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "5cd554278292150c6035b6e2dee9cc8fa76b4d9305436cdef3a295e9191d09ff", "ja": "あと、私の役って、あずささんの妹なだけじゃなくて、\n育りんのお姉さまでもあったでしょ？", "zh": "还有，我的角色不仅是梓小姐的妹妹，\n还是育姐姐姐对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "ba7e885112cfd8135b56c714dc3c607e5a608ae34b7dc85b7e9bc84715dd4d28", "ja": "私自身は、妹だから。お姉ちゃんの役もできるんだ～！\nって思ったら、なんだかすっごくうれしかったの☆", "zh": "我自己就是妹妹嘛。一想到我也能演姐姐，就觉得特别开心呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "ff5ad5d813bd80494dbcd19aa1e48c317c640c5a611fc7a553ed369bb578da23", "ja": "だから今日のインタビューでも、私のこと、ステキな\nお姉さまだって思ってもらえるといいな……えへへ♪", "zh": "所以我也希望，今天的采访能让大家觉得我是个很棒的姐姐……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dc770a06a0278c4da5220b63d65a6feea435469bc374394f1b3187745d0c6787", "ja": "はは、そうだな。今回のドラマを見て、\nお姉さまの海美に憧れるファンが大勢増えたと思う！", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。我觉得看了这次的电视剧后，憧憬海美姐姐的粉丝一定增加了很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "f892793088c723fe969c49244ce7f9951803c070b13ed02912c777377cd523e9", "ja": "ホント！？　よ～し、がんばるぞ！　……あっ。\nでも私、ひとつだけ気になってるんだけど……。", "zh": "真的吗！？好——我会加油的！……啊。\n不过，我有一件事有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "10f961f35b294d81b20bfdd52d2ce2af9a465dbdd35cc44714d57d4630d19ccd", "ja": "おしとやかなお嬢さま役をしてるとね、なんだか\nだんだん、体がぷるぷるとか、ムズムズしてくるの。", "zh": "演淑女优雅的大小姐时，总觉得身体会渐渐变得一阵发抖，或者痒痒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0233_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "943fe9214e0addc948189eeaef50c7edee8a3bf3d760305877f03dc486b0b277", "ja": "これって、どうしてなんだろ……？\n{$P$}、わかる？", "zh": "这是为什么呢……？\n{$P$}，你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
